# Scratch output dirs stay on disk; `results/` (the committed JSONL evidence) is re-included.
# NOTE — this file has a SECOND effect on purpose: biome.json runs with `vcs.useIgnoreFile: true` and does
# not honour the negations, so a directory-local ignore file takes the whole probe dir out of biome's
# scope. That is how `scripts/probes/rpg-extraction/` is already exempt, and why these throwaway harnesses
# may use `process.env` + raw wire literals (the constitution excepts throwaway scripts + dev tooling from
# the architecture rigor). Nothing here ships.
*/
!results/
